  "H4100": {
    "orig": "מה מ־ מ־ מה מה",
    "tran": "mâh mah mâ ma meh",
    "phon": "maw",
    "bdbd": "1.  what, how, of what kind (interrogative pronoun)\n    a.  (interrogative)\n        1.  what?\n        2.  of what kind\n        3.  what? (rhetorical)\n        4.  whatsoever, whatever, what\n    b.  (adverb)\n        1.  how, how now\n        2.  why\n        3.  how! (exclamation)\n    c.  (with preposition)\n        1.  wherein?, whereby?, wherewith?, by what means?\n        2.  because of what?\n        3.  the like of what?\n            a.  how much?, how many?, how often?\n            b.  for how long?\n        4.  for what reason?, why?, to what purpose?\n        5.  until when?, how long?, upon what?, wherefore?\n2.  anything, aught, what may (indefinite pronoun)",
    "orin": "a primitive particle",
    "twot": "1149",
    "posp": "",
    "sdef": "A primitive particle; properly interrogitive what ?\n(including how ?, why ? and when ?); but also exclamations like what !\n(including how !), or indefinitely what (including whatever, and even\nrelatively that which); often used with prefixes in various adverbial or\nconjugational sneses: - how (long, oft, [-soever]), [no-] thing, what\n(end, good, purpose, thing), whereby (-fore, -in, -to, -with), (for)\nwhy.",
    "atra": "mh",
    "shor": "What, how, of what kind (interrogative pronoun)"
  },
