    "twot": "None",
    "posp": "Proper Name Person",
    "sdef": "From H4600; depression ; Maakah (or Maakath), the\nname of a place in Syria, also of a Mesopotamian, of three Israelites,\nand of four Israelitesses and one Syrian woman: - Maachah, Maachathites.\nSee also H1038.",
    "atra": "mach",
    "shor": "Maachathites = \" pressure (literally she has pressed)\". Father of Achish, king of Gath at the beginning of Solomon's reign"
