    "tran": "Balaam",
    "phon": "bal-ah-am'",
    "thad": "1.  A native of Pethor a city in Mesopotamia, endued by Jehovah with\n    prophetic power. He was hired by Balak to curse the Israelites; and\n    influenced by the love of reward, he wished to gratify Balak; but he\n    was compelled by Jehovah's power to bless them. Hence later the Jews\n    saw him as a most abandoned deceiver.",
