    "orin": "a prolonged form of a primary verb",
    "tdnt": "12:29,1",
    "posp": "Verb",
    "sdef": "A prolonged form of a primary verb; to \" know\"\n(absolutely), in a great variety of applications and with many\nimplications (as shown at left, with others not thus clearly\nexpressed): - allow, be aware (of), feel, (have) known (-ledge),\nperceive, be resolved, can speak, be sure, understand.",
