    "tdnt": "08:41,8",
    "posp": "Verb",
    "sdef": "The first is a reduplicated and contracted form of\nthe second (which occurs only as an alternate in certain tenses);\nprobably akin to G4072 through the idea of alighting ; to fall\n(literally of figuratively): - fail, fall (down), light on.",
