    "posp": "Noun Neuter",
    "sdef": "Or the masculine plural form, στάδιος stadios\nstad'-ee-os.\nFrom the base of G2476 (as fixed); a stade or certain measure of\ndistance; by implication a stadium or race course: - furlong, race.",
